Modern Folk\" collection","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/88cfd442120d32e304dd54b904d9ee2c06c1d8c518a98b8c46260e826fe0b27f76a8df92d3533fac08f9c2eca61ff975ef14b7f27b34b4991909d9514e47e177","height":788,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/IRs_xtAG8TDlyXFRJiuJvcviONO1BXhj_ozT328ctmsewApkdLncPJMmizDJpXXbFUuDaJH-4jnRP9Tek0-M0SBXy7pUo5ej3mpHZbg3zbC_sag4d1E","width":1400}},{"a11y_description":"Illustration from the \"Sci-Fi\" collection","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/5db2c3af83932b04b1ca770dfb03ad2047e793a5bc782459a78c6c58f21e4c7df6723527afbe2b62f88fe68ef7a63140f8294046135d537232548f11ecd54320","height":788,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/9kq1UNUjO1F86J4xvya2O-4mcUo24djjcqqoNiiL6Gtn59yoIUjWF8qMuUti1xXNbkY0MjZAu5vnSA4Ah0Df0Sbu2p42GVvivnX-yj6jS8uGOOjowMg","width":1400}}],"related_links":[],"table":[],"video":[]}],"category":"2022","hero":{"a11y_description":"Abstract illustration of flowers and geometric shapes","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/04b96a889dcf539bf06c474e835b5f57afd92a7bf35be277c95148af636abe1fe3dcb72a028384971810e601aadc1b15ea129155eb47fe5c4bccd8083e765135","height":788,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/Xnu_XzomsPU4COc9S-WeIoG4NGSt9WQTZpqV7DdPOX6uhx8F2_--V74HslS_bdTpBXIbretlJxpORHkv8qTYcu6nb35VpA4yW-Ts80CexWJxIxVe_uA","width":1400}},"hero_card":false,"metadata":{"keywords":"case-studies partners editorial","meta_robots":" ","schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"探索（并下载）为 Material Design 3 网站注入生命力的全新插画","share_image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/3bb0d8cfd06657e604566c4e4d2e0d75b718e9fee5f101814ab208a5406895f7e000c2fbaab9186315a849a54674079dbff9347be10d754a24cacf5fb9a72dc5","heigh